    <briefdescription>
<para>Produce an estimate of the unrolled cost of the specified loop. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is used to a) produce a cost estimate for partial unrolling and b) to cheaply estimate cost for full unrolling when we don&apos;t want to symbolically evaluate all iterations. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
